{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Squash and Spell is a fun &amp; friendly game designed for children as soon as they show an interest to interact with a computer.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fun on screen representation of all the letters in the alphabet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387970/extras/Letters.gif?t=1742387626\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A spelling rainbow with lots of words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A word processor mode which lets children type and see the result.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387970/extras/rainbow.gif?t=1742387626\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully voice acted, including a toggle for phonics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A writing mode where, depending on hardware, children can use a stylus, touch or mouse to draw letters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387970/extras/writing.gif?t=1742387626\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time of day system with cosy ambient sounds.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3387970?t=1742387626","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/